            ["Rule-based fan floor, independent of the model", "none", "35 C start duty, 38 C 800 rpm, 42 C full (on the delayed sensor, each tick)", f"stuck planner peaks {f(r_n200['peak_k'])} to {f(r_n500['peak_k'])} C at 200 to 500 W ({f(r_c400['peak_k'])} C at 400 W with C/2) instead of {f(self.stuck('lump2', 'nominal', 200.0, 'stuck')['peak_k'])} to {f(self.stuck('lump2', 'nominal', 500.0, 'stuck')['peak_k'])} C ({f(s_c400['peak_k'])} C with C/2)", "Yes up to the radiator capacity; beyond it only delays the takeover"],
            ["Fan rate up", "+700 rpm / tick", "+700", f"full from stop in {S['ramp_s']['up_stop_to_full']:.0f} s, costs about 1 K at 400 W (6.6)", "Yes (about 2 K)"],
